  "description": "ESORUA crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2. Reported CIF formula moiety: C39 H91 Dy5 O14. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy5? (Dy) has 0 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 10 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.340-5.002 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 83.99-177.23°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy5O(OiPr)13]. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 13 OiPr (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
